# Local-dev Worker secrets for `getCloudflareContext().env` (read by
# initOpenNextCloudflareForDev when running `CF_DEV=1 pnpm dev`).
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in. For prod, set the same key with
# `wrangler secret put ADMIN_JANITOR_TOKEN`.

# Bearer token guarding POST /api/admin/janitor (the inactivity-TTL janitor).
ADMIN_JANITOR_TOKEN="dev-only-pick-any-string"
